%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S12_4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: When we enter the room we see the silver haired man sitting on the sofa.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It must be his tea time right now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I notice the cup of tea in front of him.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Father, I have something to tell you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Moon looks surprised when he sees us.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Where have you been? You suddenly disappeared that day and nobody was able
      to find you!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I'm sorry, father. But we can explain everything that happened, if you'd
      just listen\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He pierces me with an unimpressed stare.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hmph. It must have something to do with that brat you've been taking here.
      I've found you suspicious the moment I laid my eyes on you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But be as it may, it's good that you're both here. The Crown Prince will be arriving here any
      minute now to discuss how his search of my dear daughter has been going.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ugh, not again. Why must he always be here to interfere?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Father! Please, listen to us first! that man can't be trusted! He will
      betray me in the end! And we can prove it!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 10
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What nonsense are you spouting right now, child? How exactly would he betray
      us? We both have something to gain and nothing to lose in this marriage.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Gosh, would you please just listen to your daughter?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel how Scarlet tenses up beside me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He loves someone else! He just plans to throw me away ass soon as we're
      married. We'll lose the rights to the mines as well. And then it will all be
      for nothing.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 10
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Moon scoffs.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: This is all you're afraid of? There are a lot of marriages that don't involve
      love. This is for the greater good of our family. I might have kept something
      from you until now, but I'll tell you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In exchange for marrying you and obtaining the mining rights that way, we will get access to the imperial silver chamber.
      That means they cannot make any more weapons that will be troublesome for our
      family.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel rage filling my head and can't hold back any longer.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: How could you marry off your daughter like that? She truly loved the Prince
      but he hurt her so much! don't you care about her at all?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Who do you think you are? How dare you question me. Love is a fleeting
      and useless thing. As soon as the Prince dies, it would be over anyways.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Suddenly, we hear a nock on the door.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Your grace, the Crown Prince has arrived.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0a0b0c0d0e0f10111213141516171819, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I see the color draining from Scarlet's face.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh, here we go.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Let him in.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Amon enters the room and looks surprised when he sees us.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: My Lady? When did you come back? What a pleasant surprise! I was quite
      worried about you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c4b2a190f3e4d5c6b7a8190a1b2c3d4, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We tried to end things peacefully, but it seems like it was in vain. Nobody
      here is willing to listen.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 10
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What's the meaning of this, Lady Scarlet? End what peacefully? Surely,
      you are not talking about our marriage, right?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c4b2a190f3e4d5c6b7a8190a1b2c3d4, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, the marriage will be happening. I will see to it.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That's not what Scarlet wants!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Amon glances at me, and I can feel that he's appalled by my presence here.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Who are you to address the Lady so casually? Not even I have dared to call
      herby her first name only.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c4b2a190f3e4d5c6b7a8190a1b2c3d4, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oops. I forgot, I was so used to calling her that, that it just slipped
      out.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet positions herself between me and the Prince.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You're right Prince Amon. I might have genuinely loved you once, but now
      I know that you have someone else in your heart. I want us to go our separate
      ways from now on.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The Prince is silent for a while.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He then drops his forced smile and he shows a more relaxed but condescending
      expression.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Fine. i don't know how you found out, but it doesn't matter. Both your
      father and me want this marriage. That's more than enough. We can just divorce
      a day after, no?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c4b2a190f3e4d5c6b7a8190a1b2c3d4, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I decline. I'm just asking you to leave me alone. I'm sure you can find
      another family with greater assets that will please the king.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Amon is visibly annoyed now, the veins are popping out of his neck.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Duke. it seems like you still have to teach your daughter a lesson.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c4b2a190f3e4d5c6b7a8190a1b2c3d4, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet's father appears to be a little flustered.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: My apologies, your Highness. Guards! Take my daughter and this insolent
      intruder to the confinement cells!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Soon after he shouts his command, several armed guards appear and try to
      seize us.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c25807cf07d3642429ff3af939d3ec19, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Stop! You can't make me marry this man!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 10
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She looks at me pleadingly.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I know what I have to do.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I nod in Scarlet's direction to let her know, that I've got her back.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She pulls out her dagger, trying to defend herself without getting anyone
      hurt.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: As quickly as possible, I scan the room.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: There's Amon and the duke. Also, there are about six guards.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Three of them are trying to keep me still by gripping both my arms and
      the back of my neck.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Good, there's physical contact.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I start initiating the shift, even though I'm worried about shifting more
      than two people for the first time.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Please work!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I squeeze my eyes shot, trying to concentrate as much as I can.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 70a7a049a9d73584984badc2185da3c5, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e4d59e19e7dcee45b1a9160ea4952f5, type: 2}
